<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 128,000 lbs of zinc.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 128,000 lbs of zinc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 128,000 lbs of zinc to two companies for a total of $87,089.</p>
<p>I Shumann &amp; Co bought 88,000 lbs at 68.42 to 67.92 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Allied Fence bought 40,000 lbs at 67.75 cents a lb.</p>
<p>The next offer of Stockpile zinc is on August 19.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
